Vima: ovladac SC3336 - rezim 1152x648 @ 60 fps (varianta D)

Snimac cte radky ob jeden (svisle preskakovani, registry 0x3215 = 0x31, 0x3220 = 0x01), posila 2304x648
pres MIPI 510 Mbit/s a sirku na 1152 zmensi ISP. VTS 680 = 60 fps. Parametr modulu bin60 (vychozi 1).
Vyber varianty a mereni: docs/notes/sc3336-60fps-test-20261027.md.

Licence: GPL-2.0 (Linux kernel). Ve firmwaru: NE. Na desce bezi stejna varianta prelozena mimo strom
jadra jako /oem/usr/ko/sc3336.ko (air/sc3336-60fps).

